{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3bac50ec8614d1fb","name":"E-Web Repeating Blaster","source":{"id":"source:reference-3bac50ec8614d1fb","title":"E-Web Repeating Blaster","revision":24988,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:48:06Z","sha256":"b609fc8899d6c77e29c83838f3ddf19ed9fe390a5c66fd0bf087263138c78b48","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24988","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=E-Web%20Repeating%20Blaster&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3bac50ec8614d1fb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The E-Web Repeating Blaster can normally only be fired when mounted on a tripod. When mounted on a tripod, it is treated as one size smaller for purposes of being wielded (allowing a Medium character to operate it with two hands). The E-Web Repeating Blaster only operates in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," mode, and requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"}," to operate. Normally, the E-Web Repeating Blaster requires a second crewman to regulate the weapon's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"},"; this second crewman must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," while adjacent to the weapon to regulate its power.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After you regulate the E-Web Repeating Blaster's power, it will function normally until the beginning of your next turn. If the weapon's power is not regulated (that is, if the second crewman has not done so since the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Count"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Count"}," on the previous round), apply a -2 penalty on all attack rolls made with the weapon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Is the weight on the E-Web Repeating Blaster correct? It seems awfully heavy compared to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:485c08c7b8997444"},", which is only one size smaller and in the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Yes, the weights are correct. Don't forget that the E-Web's weight includes a dedicated power generator, which is roughly 15 kg by itself. In addition, the E-Web Repeating Blaster uses a very large and heavy tripod to assist its crew in wielding such a massive weapon, whereas the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:485c08c7b8997444"}," uses a smaller tripod that is designed to be portable (allowing you to fire on the run, albeit inaccurately).\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Huge\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 8,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," Only\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 38 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," An E-Web Repeating Blaster mounted on a tripod is treated as a Large weapon, rather than Huge.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
